{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KORRIDOR</strong> is a medieval shoot-them-up in which you slay hordes of demons with a massive Gatling gun!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the catacombs and explore 4 unique levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with 25 items and experiment with dozens of playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in many leaderboard categories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy bosses and loot powerful artifacts!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has <strong>66 achievements</strong> and will take between 10 and 15 hours to complete. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also unlock many items of <strong>historical trivia\u00a0</strong>about the central middle ages (years 1000 - 1300), on topics like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The role of the church, Papacy, and monk orders in medieval society</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The relationship between Kings and Popes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crusades and heresies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval Philosophy</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3739580?t=1759949736","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739580/409c8e5477d73423e3cf6a641bbb319bc804a277/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759949736","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739580/282a472fddb8bff59d495bd579ea50a1e178b909/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759949736","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739580/282a472fddb8bff59d495bd579ea50a1e178b909/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759949736","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3849780,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KORRIDOR</strong> is a medieval shoot-them-up in which you slay hordes of demons with a massive Gatling gun!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Delve into the catacombs and explore 4 unique levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize your character with 25 items and experiment with dozens of playstyles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Compete in many leaderboard categories</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Destroy bosses and loot powerful artifacts!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game has <strong>66 achievements</strong> and will take between 10 and 15 hours to complete. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You will also unlock many items of <strong>historical trivia\u00a0</strong>about the central middle ages (years 1000 - 1300), on topics like:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The role of the church, Papacy, and monk orders in medieval society</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The relationship between Kings and Popes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Crusades and heresies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Medieval Philosophy</p></li></ul>","developers":["TinyToad"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3739580/6d6fea5275ce8f5455c72b50aa44581147329ec5/header.jpg?t=1759949736","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Martin Jacob, all rights reserved","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3739580/12003470/e6c2f13ec034bcea7ef0dc9196988b3c759f4ddd/1759949102/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759949734","dash_h264":"https